# Headers on boardo.kaiserkhan.com (Cloudflare reads this file; it isn't served).

# Every page and file: never shown inside another site's frame (the connect page's Allow
# included), no guessing of file types, only the origin sent on to other sites, HTTPS only, and
# no camera, microphone or location. The content policy only reports for now (in the browser's
# console): once it has run quietly for a while, rename it Content-Security-Policy. The hash is
# the theme script in index.html; change one and the other must follow (src/lib/headers.test.ts
# checks). Turnstile (challenges.cloudflare.com) is there for when it's turned on.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), serial=(), bluetooth=(), hid=()
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'sha256-VLT1Bg6oMdwz2T5o3AXnbM52fDEFxG2GHQXR46tQJq0=' https://challenges.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' wss://boardo.kaiserkhan.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com; worker-src 'self'; manifest-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'

# Cache rules. The page, sw.js, version.json and the manifest keep Cloudflare's default: checked
# with the server every time, so a new build is seen at once.

# Build files have their content's hash in the name, so they never change.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Icons with fixed names may change between releases (their links carry ?v=N): a day.
/icon*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
